 It is highly probable that this would be discussed next.\n\nB) The unique effect of artemisinin in the treatment of lupus erythematosus.\n- The context mentions that new progress has been made in the treatment of lupus erythematosus using artemisinin. This is a specific application of the drug and would likely be discussed next.\n\nC) The contribution of scientific research works of traditional chinese medicine to the world.\n- The context acknowledges the recognition of scientific research works in traditional Chinese medicine by the World Health Organization and domestic experts. This is a broader topic that could be relevant, but it is not directly tied to the specific issue of drug resistance.\n\nD) The cause of the problem of drug resistance of artemisinin.\n- The context mentions that the team has made new breakthroughs in understanding the causes of drug resistance. This is a crucial aspect of the research and would likely be discussed next. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
