nd the intensity of the withdrawal reactions.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.\n</think>.\n<answer>Therefore, my final option is: B</answer>.<|User|>Got it, thank you for the detailed explanation. I understand now.\n<|Assistant|><answer>\nYou're welcome! If you have any more questions or need further clarification, feel free to ask. Understanding these types of logical reasoning problems can be quite helpful in various contexts.\n</answer>",
