nA) The British government would deny the requests by civilian researchers to have access to the data only if this government had something to hide.\n- This option suggests that the government's refusal to release information is due to a desire to hide something. While it supports the idea that the government might be withholding information, it does not directly link the sightings to extraterrestrial origins.\n\nB) The British government is less trusting of civilian researchers than it is of military researchers. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
