ish carefully).\n\nB) Xiao li is a basketball player who practices shooting repeatedly in the hope of leading his team to victory.\n- This option also fits the definition of achievement motivation because:.\n  - Xiao li is pursuing important and valuable work (playing basketball).\n  - He sets high standards for himself (repeatedly practicing).\n  - He aims to achieve success (leading the team to victory).\n  - He strives for perfection (repeatedly practicing).\n\nC) Xiao zhang is an enterprise leader who often tells his employees to finish their work consciously and with high quality.\n- This option does not fit the definition of achievement motivation because:.\n  - While Xiao zhang is setting high standards for his employees, he is not pursuing important and valuable work himself.\n  - He is not aiming for success as his own goal.\n  - He is not striving for perfection in his own work. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
