re concerns about harmful effects, so this option is not accurate.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**\n   - Option B is the only one that correctly reflects the harmful effects mentioned in the context, without contradicting the beneficial effects.\n\nTherefore, the correct option is B.\n</think>.\n<answer>Therefore, the correct option is B.</answer>",
