n   - If Zhao Jie was ticked by someone, Wang Ming would also tick Zhao Jie.\n   - Therefore, Zhao Jie is ticked by Wang Ming.\n\n5. **Analyzing Li Zilu's Action:**.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.\n   - Since Zhao Jie was ticked by Wang Ming, Zhao Jie is not ticked by Li Zilu.\n   - Therefore, Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\n\n6. **Conclusion:**.\n   - Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu did not tick Zhao Jie.\n   - Since Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote, and Zhao Jie did not get the full vote (as Li Zilu did not tick him), Li Zilu must have ticked someone else.\n\n7. **Determining the Other Ticked Candidates:**.\n   - Since Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote, and Zhao Jie did not get the full vote, Li Zilu must have ticked Zhang Hao (as he did not tick anyone).\n   - Therefore, Li Zilu ticked Zhang Hao.\n\n8. **Final Analysis:**.\n   - Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu ticked Zhang Hao.\n   - Since Wang Ming and Li Zilu did not tick each other (Wang Ming ticked Zhao Jie, and Li Zilu ticked Zhang Hao, who is not Zhao Jie), the correct answer is that Wang Ming and Li Zilu did not tick each other. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
