he surrounding areas.\n- This describes a human activity (using a lot of fossil fuels) leading to a change in the environmental system (higher temperature). This is an environmental effect.\n\nD) A coastal city reclaimed the sea to build an island, and a small town with a capacity of 70,000 people was built on the island.\n- This describes a human activity (reclaiming the sea to build an island) leading to the creation of a new landform and settlement. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
