uthor's city.**.\n   - This option provides broader evidence that violent crime is out of control across the nation, which supports the conclusion rather than casts doubt on it.\n\nC) **Police records show that people experience more violent crimes in their own neighborhoods than they do outside their neighborhoods.**.\n   - This option suggests that violent crime is more prevalent in specific areas, but it does not directly address the overall increase in coverage or the perception of crime. It does not necessarily cast doubt on the conclusion that violent crime is out of control. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
