implies that he believes governments should allow people to help others voluntarily.\n- **Conclusion:** Raphaela and Edward agree on this point.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B. Raphaela and Edward disagree about the truth of the statement that \"Any government that permits emigration has the right to redistribute resources via taxation.\"<|Assistant|> <answer>B</answer>",
